    <user>anag_factory</user>
    <comment>- Add missing libavfilter buildrequires.
- Update to 3.3.0
  * Changes
    Gerbera 3.3.0 (#3934)
    Doxygen: silence warnings (#3930)
    Make Layout Options consistent (#3895)
    Refactor Sql hash codes (#3877)
    Bump master (#3835)
  * Features
    Add internal Transcoding (#3867)
    Add server flags for dynamic description (#3904)
    Add quirk NoSecNamespace for Universum DAB+ Internet Radio (#3901)
    Database selection from command line (#3879)
    Add ImportMode to AutoScan settings (#3876)
    Add support for cuesheets (#3840)
  * Bug Fixes
    Fix stack exhaustion via nested search criteria (#3936)
    Fix SQL injection via search container (#3924)
    Fix search for multiple properties (#3920)
    add missing headers (#3889)
    Handle url decoding correctly for npupnp (#3882)
    Fix mysql migration 29 (#3878)
    Fix potential nullptr dereference (#3875)
    Fix SQLDatabase::getRefObjects SQL on MySQL/MariaDB (#3865)
    Extend length of lyrics (#3863)
    Fix SQL injection via search parameters (#3860)
    Fix for SQL Error when using postgresql (#3854)
    Fix sqlite resource migration (#3850)
    Fix saving some config properties from ui (#3847)
    Fix includes (#3841)
  * Dependencies
    Bump adm-zip from 0.6.0 to 0.6.1 in /gerbera-web (#3938)
    Drop EOL distros (#3932)
    Update to pupnp 22.1.0 (#3931)
    Update to taglib 2.3.2 (#3929)
    Bump serialize-javascript and mocha in /gerbera-web (#3928)
    Bump fast-uri from 3.1.5 to 3.1.7 in /gerbera-web (#3927)
    Update Build Environment (#3917)
    Update to pupnp 22.0.6 (#3916)
    Update to googletest 1.18.0 (#3914)
    Bump fast-uri from 3.1.4 to 3.1.5 in /gerbera-web (#3913)
    Bump ip-address from 10.2.0 to 10.4.0 in /gerbera-web (#3912)
    Bump shell-quote and concurrently in /gerbera-web (#3910)
    Update to taglib 2.3.1 (#3908)
    Bump actions/setup-node from 6 to 7 (#3906)
    Bump actions/setup-python from 6 to 7 (#3907)
    Update to pupnp 22.0.4 (#3905)
    Bump actions/cache from 5 to 6 (#3900)
    Use latest utfcpp directly (#3896)
    Bump form-data from 4.0.5 to 4.0.6 in /gerbera-web (#3892)
    Bump actions/checkout from 6 to 7 (#3893)
    Update to pupnp 2.0.2 - pugixml 1.16 - fmt 12.2.0 (#3890)
    Bump shell-quote and concurrently in /gerbera-web (#3887)
    Collected Updates (#3886)
    Bump tmp from 0.2.5 to 0.2.7 in /gerbera-web (#3872)
    build support for resolute raccoon (#3871)
    Bump qs and body-parser in /gerbera-web (#3869)
    Bump js-cookie from 3.0.5 to 3.0.7 in /gerbera-web (#3868)
    Update to taglib 2.3 (#3866)
    Bump @babel/plugin-transform-modules-systemjs from 7.29.0 to 7.29.4 in /gerbera-web (#3862)
    Bump fast-uri from 3.1.0 to 3.1.2 in /gerbera-web (#3861)
    Bump axios from 1.15.0 to 1.16.0 in /gerbera-web (#3858)
    Bump ip-address from 10.1.0 to 10.2.0 in /gerbera-web (#3857)
    Update to pupnp 1.18.5 (#3855)
    Bump follow-redirects from 1.15.11 to 1.16.0 in /gerbera-web (#3852)
    Bump axios from 1.13.6 to 1.15.0 in /gerbera-web (#3846)
    Bump basic-ftp from 5.2.1 to 5.2.2 in /gerbera-web (#3845)
    Bump basic-ftp from 5.2.0 to 5.2.1 in /gerbera-web (#3843)
    Bump lodash from 4.17.23 to 4.18.1 in /gerbera-web (#3842)
    Bump picomatch from 2.3.1 to 2.3.2 in /gerbera-web (#3837)
- Drop gerbera-pugixml-1.16-tests.patch because now in upstream.
- Add gerbera-pugixml-1.16-tests.patch to fix ExampleConfigGeneratorTest
  with pugixml &gt;= 1.16, which prints empty elements as &lt;node /&gt; instead
  of &lt;node&gt;&lt;/node&gt; (gh#gerbera/gerbera#3890).
- Update to 3.2.1
  * Features
    - Run cmake-format (#3829)
    - Add autolabeler (#3824)
  * Bug Fixes
    - Fix init with disabled ffmpegthumbnailer (#3834)
    - Fix SQL Migration Statement (#3823)
  * Dependencies
    - Update to jsoncpp 1.9.7 (#3830)
    - Bump flatted from 3.4.1 to 3.4.2 in /gerbera-web (#3831)
    - Run cmake-format (#3829)
    - Update/autolabeler (#3828)
    - Update to pupnp 1.18.3 (#3826)
    - Add Autolabeler (#3827) 
    - Add Autolabeler (#3825)
    - Bump ReleaseDrafter from 6 to 7 (#3821)
- Update to 3.2.0
  * NEW Features
    - Split config files into modules (from-file)
    - Export and import changed objects
    - Extract Matroska metadata also with taglib 2.2.1
    - Select content type for import library to reduce import time
  * FIXES
    - Timeouts in transcoding or other read errors leading to broken responses
    - LastFM with rest API
    - Configuration for FFmpeg stream data import to reduce import times
    - Error return codes to LibPUPnP
  * Code Improvements
    - Remove prefix for location type in database
    - Object Flags refactored to enum
    - Update maximum versions of npupnp (6.2.3), cmake (4.2.3), pupnp (1.18.2), taglib (2.2.1), libexiv2 (0.28.8)
    - cxxopts was updated to version 3.3.1 and can now be updated like any library
  * Changes
    - Gerbera 3.2.0 (#3817)
    - Update cxxopts to 3.3.1 (#3816)
    - Fix entryType for builtin layout (#3815)
    - Convert ObjectFlags to enum (#3813)
    - Upgrade broken check-socket stuff (#3807)
    - Bump docker/setup-buildx-action from 3 to 4 (#3808)
    - Bump docker/setup-qemu-action from 3 to 4 (#3809)
    - Bump docker/build-push-action from 6 to 7 (#3810)
    - Bump docker/login-action from 3 to 4 (#3811)
    - Bump docker/metadata-action from 5 to 6 (#3812)
    - More configuration of online content (#3806)
    - Improve configuration of online content (#3804)
    - Threading and Transcoding with better configuration (#3803)
    - Bump actions/upload-artifact from 6 to 7 (#3801)
    - Update libexiv2 to 0.28.8 (#3799)
    - Update npm and web ui tests (#3798)
    - Bump minimatch in /gerbera-web (#3797)
    - xsd improvement (#3796)
    - Reduce almost duplicate methods (#3794)
    - Bump basic-ftp from 5.1.0 to 5.2.0 in /gerbera-web (#3795)
    - Split off Database Migrations (#3793)
    - Refactor FFMpegThumbnailer (#3791)
    - Extend content type filter configuration (#3789)
    - FFmpeg: configuration for stream data import (#3788)
    - Update to pupnp 1.18.0 (#3784)
    - Upgrade to taglib 2.2 with new file type and filtering (#3782)
    - Use entry_type instead of location prefix (#3781)
    - Bump qs from 6.14.1 to 6.14.2 in /gerbera-web (#3780)
    - Update to pupnp 1.14.29 (#3779)
    - Update to pupnp 1.14.27 (#3777)
    - Update to pupnp 1.14.26 (#3775)
    - Export and import changed object from database (#3772)
    - Show changed items in UI (#3771)
    - Keep track of changed objects (#3770)
    - Bump lodash from 4.17.21 to 4.17.23 in /gerbera-web (#3768)
    - Update npupnp to 6.2.3 (#3767)
    - Document MARIADB_TLS_DISABLE_PEER_VERIFICATION (#3766)
    - Load Config file modules (#3764)
    - Bump master (#3763)
- Update to 3.1.1
  * FIXES
    - docker startup under default user
  * Code Improvements
    - Update maximum versions of wavpack (5.9.0), cmake (4.2.1)
  * Changes
    - Gerbera 3.1.1 (#3762)
    - Update wavpack to 5.9.0 (#3759)
    - cope with su-exec breaking change (#3757)
    - Bump master (#3758)
- Update to 3.1.0
  - accumulate to join
  - Add community scripts
  - add missing array headers
  - add missing headers from headers
  - Align transcoding flag documentation and code
  - Avoid string_view conversion
  - Bump actions/cache from 4 to 5
